d 'QRBREAK': module to test and estimate structural breaks in quantile regression 
d
d    qrbreak tests for structural breaks occurring at unknown dates
d in regression quantiles    and estimates the break dates, their
d confidence intervals, and the regression    coefficients in each
d regime.  The analysis is carried out both quantile by quantile
d (the	  SQ test of Qu 2008) and jointly over a range of quantiles
d (the DQ test of Oka and Qu	2011).	The number of breaks is
d determined by a sequential testing procedure, break	 dates are
d estimated by dynamic programming, and confidence intervals for
d the break dates    are constructed under the shrinking-break
d asymptotic framework of Oka and Qu (2011). 
d
d KW: structural breaks
d KW: quantile regression
d
d Requires: Stata version 16
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260802
d
d Author: Ozan Eruygur,  Ankara Haci Bayram Veli University
d Support: email eruygur@@gmail.com
d
f qrbreak.ado
f qrbreak.sthlp
F qrbreak_core_macosx_arm64.plugin
F qrbreak_core_macosx_x86_64.plugin
F qrbreak_core_unix.plugin
F qrbreak_core_windows.plugin
